      "side": 1,
      "message": "TL;DR we only use the code ram from one of RW or RO. We are only using about 145KiB (including .data section), which is much less than 320KiB. I did lower this number further and it does look like we do fail the build. Bug b/357938320 makes seeing this a little weird. See the other comment on this CL.\n\nI keep comfortable with this change, considering how far we are from the actual limits.",
